    "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:54:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-05T23:54:22Z",
    "body": "It seems the limit has been hit (unintentionally). Note that this limit is separate to how many entries are stored in history. Calling pushState many times is trivial in terms of resource use, but a limit is needed to stop e.g. infinite loops.\n\nNot throwing results in silent data loss which could be quite frustrating for developers to figure out what is going on.\n\nCc @noamr ",
